# Applies to every Docker build that uses the monorepo root as its build
# context (auth-server/Dockerfile, tests/e2e-auth-tests/Dockerfile,
# tests/example-nextjs-resource-server/Dockerfile, auth-postgres-db/Dockerfile).
# Every Dockerfile COPYs explicit files/directories, so excluding local
# dependency installs, build caches, and runtime artifacts only shrinks the
# build context -- nothing below is ever copied into an image.

.git

**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo

# Local database state (mounted as a volume, never built into an image)
**/postgres-data

# Cypress runtime artifacts (mounted as volumes by the E2E compose file)
**/cypress/videos
**/cypress/screenshots

# Local env files must never enter a build context
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
deploy/auth-server.env
